# Everything the build produces itself, or must never enter an image.
#
# `node_modules` in particular: the build installs its own from the lockfile, and copying a host
# tree over it would replace a verified install with whatever happened to be on a laptop.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage

# CI configuration describes how the project is built, not how it runs. It has no business inside a
# distributed artifact, and a scan of the last image found it there.
.github

# Secrets, in every shape this repository has ever held one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.staging.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
